{"id": "en_blackout_city_p2", "total": 76.63, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. Toxic smoke fills the high stairwell while all emergency alarms remain totally dead.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.58}, {"text": "Someone downstairs lit emergency candles, sparking an uncontrolled fire across the lower office floors.", "start": 6.06, "end": 10.32}, {"text": "All streetlights and grid power stay dead, leaving the entire city in freezing blackness.", "start": 10.84, "end": 14.96}, {"text": "Jack quickly retreats backward and walks toward his backup office shelter on the safe side.", "start": 15.66, "end": 18.82}, {"text": "Scared workers cough down the hall, but Jack urges everyone to stay low and calm.", "start": 19.4, "end": 22.72}, {"text": "He pulls his team inside the secondary suite and shuts the heavy fire door securely.", "start": 23.14, "end": 26.52}, {"text": "One. Never open doors that feel warm, and seal all door cracks with wet clothing.", "start": 26.52, "end": 30.98}, {"text": "Jack uses his stored water to soak jackets, blocking deadly carbon monoxide from seeping inside.", "start": 31.6, "end": 35.22}, {"text": "Two. Never run a generator, grill or camp stove indoors because carbon monoxide kills silently.", "start": 35.86, "end": 40.56}, {"text": "Panicked survivors downstairs try starting a gas stove, but Jack warns them through the doorway.", "start": 40.03, "end": 44.56}, {"text": "Three. Conserve battery flashlights and avoid breathing toxic smoke by staying low against the floor.", "start": 45.24, "end": 49.38}, {"text": "Jack clicks his LED flashlight to low power, preserving critical visibility through the pitch dark.", "start": 49.96, "end": 53.26}, {"text": "Remember that a closed fridge keeps food safe 4 hours and full freezers 48 hours.", "start": 53.7, "end": 57.58}, {"text": "Jack shares emergency cold rations and clean bottled water with the stranded workers beside him.", "start": 58.3, "end": 61.72}, {"text": "Sirens finally echo outside as city firefighters battle the blaze and clear the lower floors.", "start": 62.24, "end": 65.94}, {"text": "Fire crews reach Jack's sealed safe room and guide everyone down through the safe stairwell.", "start": 66.36, "end": 69.78}, {"text": "Use flashlights instead of candles during blackouts. Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 70.32, "end": 73.48}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.32], ["two.", 0.235, 0.469], ["Toxic", 1.6, 1.88], ["smoke", 1.88, 2.14], ["fills", 2.14, 2.54], ["the", 2.54, 2.84], ["high", 2.84, 3.02], ["stairwell", 3.02, 3.44], ["while", 3.44, 3.64], ["all", 3.64, 3.96], ["emergency", 3.96, 4.26], ["alarms", 4.26, 4.6], ["remain", 4.6, 4.9], ["totally", 4.9, 5.34], ["dead.", 5.34, 5.58], ["Someone", 6.06, 6.38], ["downstairs", 6.38, 6.78], ["lit", 6.78, 7.04], ["emergency", 7.04, 7.44], ["candles,", 7.44, 7.8], ["sparking", 8.04, 8.3], ["an", 8.3, 8.4], ["uncontrolled", 8.4, 8.92], ["fire", 8.92, 9.18], ["across", 9.18, 9.52], ["the", 9.52, 9.68], ["lower", 9.68, 9.8], ["office", 9.8, 10.08], ["floors.", 10.08, 10.32], ["All", 10.84, 11.18], ["streetlights", 10.85, 10.138], ["and", 11.62, 11.84], ["grid", 11.84, 12.0], ["power", 12.0, 12.18], ["stay", 12.01, 11.075], ["dead,", 12.5, 12.76], ["leaving", 13.0, 13.12], ["the", 13.12, 13.3], ["entire", 13.3, 13.64], ["city", 13.64, 13.92], ["in", 13.92, 14.08], ["freezing", 14.08, 14.48], ["blackness.", 14.48, 14.96], ["Jack", 15.66, 15.78], ["quickly", 15.78, 16.14], ["retreats", 16.14, 16.48], ["backward", 16.48, 16.78], ["and", 16.78, 16.96], ["walks", 16.96, 17.12], ["toward", 17.12, 17.36], ["his", 17.36, 17.5], ["backup", 17.37, 16.327], ["office", 17.74, 17.98], ["shelter", 17.98, 18.18], ["on", 18.18, 18.34], ["the", 18.34, 18.42], ["safe", 18.42, 18.58], ["side.", 18.58, 18.82], ["Scared", 19.4, 19.64], ["workers", 19.64, 19.9], ["cough", 19.9, 20.2], ["down", 20.2, 20.4], ["the", 20.4, 20.58], ["hall,", 20.58, 20.7], ["but", 20.7, 20.88], ["Jack", 20.88, 21.06], ["urges", 21.06, 21.38], ["ev